(2136, 22, 10, 'Media Updates - Auto Labeling and Column for Archived and Fulfilled', '<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(23, 43, 77); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Add a new column named \'Auto Archived\' in the Archived tab and \'Auto Fulfilled\' in the Fulfilled tab. </p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"105\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(23, 43, 77); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">After a bulk request, if any account number or media type is automatically moved to the Archived or Fulfilled section, assign the value \'Yes\' in the respective column. </p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"275\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(23, 43, 77); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Simultaneously, when clicking on \'View Ticket,\' display a label named \'Auto Archived\' or \'Auto Fulfilled\' next to the \'Media Request\' modal header. </p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"425\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(23, 43, 77); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Apply a red background with white text for \'Auto Archived\' and a green background with white text for \'Auto Fulfilled.\'</p>', '2025-01-10', 'low', 'completed', '2025-01-10 08:49:14', '2025-01-23 10:25:10', '2025-01-10 12:19:52', '2025-01-23 10:25:10', 0, 0),
