(2458, 22, 10, 'Bulk Request : Optimize Background Job Logic for Ticket Updates', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(23, 43, 77); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.07px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Ensure the logic checks whether a ticket requires an update before modifying the </span><code class=\"code css-1tbex3z\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" style=\"font-family: var(--ds-font-family-code, ui-monospace, Menlo, &quot;Segoe UI Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace); display: inline; padding: 2px 0.5ch; background-color: var(--ds--code--bg-color,var(--ds-background-neutral, #F4F5F7)); border-radius: var(--ds-border-radius, 3px); border-style: none; -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone; box-decoration-break: clone; color: rgb(23, 43, 77); line-height: 1.33333; overflow: auto; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; --ds--code--bg-color: var(--ds-background-neutral, #091E420F); letter-spacing: -0.07px;\">Updated At</code><span style=\"color: rgb(23, 43, 77); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.07px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> field. Inspect the background job to identify where and why the </span><code class=\"code css-1tbex3z\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" style=\"font-family: var(--ds-font-family-code, ui-monospace, Menlo, &quot;Segoe UI Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace); display: inline; padding: 2px 0.5ch; background-color: var(--ds--code--bg-color,var(--ds-background-neutral, #F4F5F7)); border-radius: var(--ds-border-radius, 3px); border-style: none; -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone; box-decoration-break: clone; color: rgb(23, 43, 77); line-height: 1.33333; overflow: auto; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; --ds--code--bg-color: var(--ds-background-neutral, #091E420F); letter-spacing: -0.07px;\">Updated At</code><span style=\"color: rgb(23, 43, 77); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.07px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> field is being updated. If the background job does not actually modify the ticket but still marks them as updated, adjust the logic to avoid unnecessary updates. Additionally, log the tickets being updated by the background job to ensure that only relevant records are affected.</span></p>', '2025-01-28', 'low', 'completed', '2025-01-28 10:41:28', '2025-02-03 17:33:49', '2025-01-28 10:57:06', '2025-02-03 17:33:49', 0, 0),
