(2889, 9, 20, 'add new features in driven hours', '<ol data-stringify-type=\"ordered-list\" data-list-tree=\"true\" class=\"p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__ordered p-rich_text_list--nested\" data-indent=\"0\" data-border=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: rgb(248, 248, 248);\"><li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px; list-style-type: unset; margin-inline-start: 20px; padding-inline-start: 8px;\">Remove the filter on the right corner.</li><li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px; list-style-type: unset; margin-inline-start: 20px; padding-inline-start: 8px;\">Add \"Total Worked Days\" on top of \"Total Worked Hours\". Implement it based on the same logic as we discussed.</li><li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px; list-style-type: unset; margin-inline-start: 20px; padding-inline-start: 8px;\">Don\'t close the expansion of driver info getting closed when we expand another driver.</li><li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px; list-style-type: unset; margin-inline-start: 20px; padding-inline-start: 8px;\">Add a button next to the company name to expand all drivers\' driven Hours.</li><li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px; list-style-type: unset; margin-inline-start: 20px; padding-inline-start: 8px;\">Add filter by group and select the dropdown next to the refresh button. The default value will be set to \"All\". All to filter by groups they are allowed and display those companies.</li><li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px; list-style-type: unset; margin-inline-start: 20px; padding-inline-start: 8px;\">Allow to expand the company or driver information just by clicking the expansion row. This means that currently, it is only expanding when we click the name of the company or driver. It should expand when we click the blank space on the right of the company and driver.</li></ol>', '2025-02-17', 'high', 'completed', '2025-02-17 07:25:12', '2025-02-21 13:33:38', '2025-02-17 07:25:16', '2025-02-21 13:33:38', 0, 0),
