(3024, 22, 10, 'Onboarding : Date Mismatch in Approval Sections', '<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(41, 42, 46); font-family: ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Ubuntu, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">I found a date discrepancy in <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">All Section Approval</strong> and <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Final Approval</strong>. By default, the system displays a date one year from the current date. If the date is modified, the updated date should carry forward unless changed again.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"229\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(41, 42, 46); font-family: ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Ubuntu, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Currently, in <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">All Section Approval</strong>, the date is shown as <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">20.02.2026(default)</strong>. I changed it to <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">25.02.2025</strong>, but in <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Final Approval</strong>, it still shows <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">20.02.2026</strong> instead of the updated date <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">25.02.2025</strong>.</p>', '2025-02-24', 'low', 'completed', '2025-02-24 05:09:00', '2025-03-06 11:04:27', '2025-02-24 05:09:03', '2025-03-06 11:04:27', 0, 0),
