(3184, 22, 28, 'Product Page - Breadcrumbs', '<p>I think there is some existing logic for breadcrumbs on the product page, we can remove this and replace it with the following:</p><p></p><p>Starting from the lowest level category, work backwards to find the last parent. The breadcrumbs should be click able and take you to the category page.</p><p></p><p>Sometimes we can drill down 3-4 levels, which will make breadcrumbs long, if it\'s 4 or more items, show the parent, hide in between with \"...\", show last 2 children. Kind of like how eachSide works on pagination.</p>', '2025-02-28', 'low', 'completed', '2025-02-28 16:37:28', '2025-03-06 11:04:47', '2025-02-28 16:39:42', '2025-03-06 11:04:47', 0, 0),
