(3479, 22, 10, 'Uploaded files are not working on ob questionnaire', '<p>Fixed: uplaoded files are not displaying when clicked on \"save\" or \"save draft\".<br>Fixed: when removed all documents from a question is was not displaying the input button automatically<br>Done: when selected the file it continues to upload that document during that period \"save\" and \"save draft\" button will be disabled and will be active again after uploading complete.</p>', '2025-03-20', 'low', 'completed', '2025-03-20 16:25:05', '2025-06-19 05:43:23', '2025-03-20 16:25:11', '2025-06-19 05:43:23', 0, 0),
(3480, 22, 28, 'MENU HOVERING', '<p>the menu dropdown is still overly fiddly and I think we need to make the menu disappear easier. For example where I have squiggled the red lines, if the mouse is here, the menu should close</p>', '2025-03-20', 'low', 'completed', '2025-03-20 16:28:11', '2025-06-19 05:43:23', '2025-03-20 16:28:15', '2025-06-19 05:43:23', 0, 0),
(3481, 22, 28, 'Customer Notes PO Toggle Box', '<p>A toggle tick box that dictates whether the customer notes will be included on the PO paperwork.</p><p></p><p>For GS Yuasa there is a blanket rule that all fleeces need to have their toggles switched to a different colour whilst in production. To make sure this wasn\'t missed it was added to customer notes so that it automatically appears on every Yuasa production PO.</p><p>Sometimes the orders do not contain fleeces and therefore the instruction is not needed and could be confusing if included.</p><p></p><p>It would be useful to have an easy access toggle on the UI that can be unticked so the note isn\'t included on paperwork.</p>', '2025-03-20', 'low', 'completed', '2025-03-20 16:29:39', '2025-06-19 05:43:23', '2025-03-20 16:29:43', '2025-06-19 05:43:23', 0, 0),
