(3501, 22, 10, 'Please apply the following conditions for email triggering:', '<ol class=\"ak-ol\" data-indent-level=\"1\" start=\"1\" style=\"margin: var(--ds-space-150, 12px) 0 0 0; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: var(--ed--list--item-counter--padding, 24px); display: flow-root; color: rgb(41, 42, 46); font-family: ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><li><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"64\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.714; font-weight: var(--ds-font-weight-regular, 400); letter-spacing: -0.005em;\">Each user should receive <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">only one email</strong>.</p></li><li style=\"margin-top: var(--ds-space-050, 4px);\"><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"108\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.714; font-weight: var(--ds-font-weight-regular, 400); letter-spacing: -0.005em;\">If the <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">transaction_type</strong> is <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">‘Partial Payment’</strong>, only <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Email No. 2</strong> should be triggered. For all other transaction types, no email should be sent.</p></li><li style=\"margin-top: var(--ds-space-050, 4px);\"><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"253\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.714; font-weight: var(--ds-font-weight-regular, 400); letter-spacing: -0.005em;\">If multiple email triggers occur, only the <strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">most recent event\'s email</strong> should be sent.</p></li></ol>', '2025-03-21', 'low', 'completed', '2025-03-21 08:56:51', '2025-06-19 05:43:23', '2025-03-21 08:57:13', '2025-06-19 05:43:23', 0, 0),
