(3668, 22, 28, 'the menu dropdown is still overly fiddly and I think we need to make the menu disappear easier. For example where I have squiggled the red lines, if the mouse is here, the menu should close', '<p>A toggle tick box that dictates whether the customer notes will be included on the PO paperwork.</p><p></p><p>For GS Yuasa there is a blanket rule that all fleeces need to have their toggles switched to a different colour whilst in production. To make sure this wasn\'t missed it was added to customer notes so that it automatically appears on every Yuasa production PO.</p><p>Sometimes the orders do not contain fleeces and therefore the instruction is not needed and could be confusing if included.</p>', '2025-03-31', 'low', 'completed', '2025-03-31 17:38:36', '2025-06-19 05:43:03', '2025-03-31 17:38:40', '2025-06-19 05:43:03', 0, 0),
