(3702, 22, 28, 'Adding multiple products at the start instead of variations of the same', '<p>I have been asked to see if we can add multiple garments at the start of a quote. Currently we can only add 1 product and multiple variations, however we have lots of quotes on multiple garments with the same decoration/quantities so it would be great if we could select multiple garments, then select the quantities (multiple or singlular) and then add the decorations to all products.</p>', '2025-04-01', 'low', 'completed', '2025-04-01 17:04:41', '2025-06-19 05:43:03', '2025-04-01 17:04:47', '2025-06-19 05:43:03', 0, 0),
