(4934, 22, 10, 'Media Dash board - linking issue', '<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"15\" style=\"margin: 0.75rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(41, 42, 46); font-family: &quot;Atlassian Sans&quot;, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgba(5, 21, 36, 0.06);\">We have found the link from the dashboard to “Pending” media tickets for agencies have incorrect linking between the pie chart links and their respective landing pages.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"185\" style=\"margin: 0.75rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(41, 42, 46); font-family: &quot;Atlassian Sans&quot;, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgba(5, 21, 36, 0.06);\">&nbsp;If we click on the “Pending” tab from the home landing page, it sends us to the correct isolated agency information for pending tickets.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"324\" style=\"margin: 0.75rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(41, 42, 46); font-family: &quot;Atlassian Sans&quot;, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgba(5, 21, 36, 0.06);\">If we click on the “Pending” slice from the dashboard pie chart, it sends us to an administrative version of the landing pages for all agencies.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"470\" style=\"margin: 0.75rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(41, 42, 46); font-family: &quot;Atlassian Sans&quot;, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgba(5, 21, 36, 0.06);\">&nbsp;I have reviewed the links for both Superlative and National Recovery and both have this issue from the newly created dashboard.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"600\" style=\"margin: 0.75rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(41, 42, 46); font-family: &quot;Atlassian Sans&quot;, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgba(5, 21, 36, 0.06);\"><strong data-renderer-mark=\"true\">Please fix this issue and check the remaining links also</strong></p>', '2025-06-23', 'low', 'completed', '2025-06-23 03:52:02', '2026-02-16 02:07:10', '2025-06-23 03:52:10', '2026-02-16 02:07:10', 0, 0),
