(4939, 22, 28, 'Left Chest Embroidery Issues 2', '<p>I keep getting reports of LC for embroidery not showing, whenever i look it works. I have just had one from <span class=\"mention\" data-index=\"65-16\" data-denotation-char=\"\" data-id=\"65-16\" data-value=\"Claire Ion\">﻿<span contenteditable=\"false\">Claire Ion</span>﻿</span> . When I looked in the background the decoration was linked, when I added it to a new order <a href=\"https://portal.dtb.co.uk/admin/quotes-v2/edit/16/34379/1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://portal.dtb.co.uk/admin/quotes-v2/edit/16/34379/1</a> but didn\'t add a variation it worked but it pulled through as A3 instead of the stitch count selected</p><p>Then when I tried to edit the order Claire was doing <a href=\"https://portal.dtb.co.uk/admin/quotes-v2/edit/16/34370\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://portal.dtb.co.uk/admin/quotes-v2/edit/16/34370</a> it let me add the decoration line by line but not via bulk update .</p><p></p><p>I also can\'t attach more than 1 screenshot for this ticket!!!!</p>', '2025-06-23', 'low', 'completed', '2025-06-23 07:18:30', '2026-02-16 02:07:10', '2025-06-23 07:18:37', '2026-02-16 02:07:10', 0, 0),
