(5632, 22, 10, 'investigated the duplicate media files listing issue, still not found any logical or code related issue', 'investigated the duplicate media files listing issue, still not found any logical or code related issue, I suspect it due to same issue which we had earlier that I have fixed on may be Thursday or Friday, because all duplicate files are of the same media type and the same day. I don\'t think this issue will occur anymore, I have removed the duplicates', '2025-08-11', 'low', 'completed', '2025-08-11 06:30:00', '2026-02-16 02:08:39', '2025-08-11 06:30:00', '2026-02-16 02:08:39', 0, 0),
