(5810, 9, 20, 'Renter Choice: DO The Task for the my work abd task modules', '<p><strong>New Changes</strong></p><ul><li>Add a search box in the <strong>Tags</strong> section to allow searching for buildings and portfolios.</li><li>On the <strong>My Task</strong> page, replace the <strong>Edit</strong> button with a <strong>View</strong> button. Inside the modal, display the <strong>Edit</strong> and <strong>Delete</strong> buttons, and remove them from the main <strong>My Task</strong> view.</li><li>The <strong>Assigned To</strong> dropdown should display a list of users filtered according to their <strong>Office Location</strong>.</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"><strong>New &nbsp;Features Added : My Tasks </strong>(Mobile App) &nbsp;</span></p><p><span data-teams=\"true\"></span></p><ul><li><strong>Add a search function in the Tags section</strong> so users can search for buildings and portfolios.</li><li><strong>Add a “View” button</strong> that opens a detailed view of each task.</li><li><strong>Allow users to delete tasks</strong> when they are no longer needed.</li><li><strong>Allow users to edit tasks</strong> directly from the “My Tasks” section.</li></ul>', '2025-09-19', 'medium', 'completed', '2025-09-19 02:54:43', '2026-02-16 02:11:57', '2025-09-19 02:54:52', '2026-02-16 02:11:57', 0, 0),
