(6514, 9, 45, 'modification in the Owner modules', '<p>Sort of</p><p>If you go into Reports on Propertyware it\'s a list of reports by report name that the user selects to be able to open and view. This view is internal user only</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you go to an owner\'s contact card and \"login as\" to their portal you can see what they actually see now as well, same idea it\'s a list of report names</p><p><span data-teams=\"true\"><span><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, system-ui, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p>Internal users have a lot more detail</p><p>Going to an owner\'s contact card you will see they have much less detail, it is simple and easy to follow along</p><p><span data-teams=\"true\"><span><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, system-ui, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p>View Report button for internal users</p><p><span data-teams=\"true\"><span><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, system-ui, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p>Go to Properties tab</p><p>We will find an owner for you to see their current portal set-up</p><p><span data-teams=\"true\"><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, system-ui, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>', '2026-02-19', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-19 09:28:58', '2026-02-28 11:50:02', '2026-