(6698, 7, 41, 'Local Environment Setup for Mae on Cascade + HubSpot Connection Work', '<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"285\" style=\"font-size: medium;\">Create a full clone of the live website (<a data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"160\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://maeoncascade.com/\">https://maeoncascade.com/<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-rtl-flip=\"\" class=\"block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]\"><use href=\"/cdn/assets/sprites-core-m5oiq452.svg#304883\" fill=\"currentColor\"></use></svg></span></a>) in the local development environment, including complete design, layout, theme configuration, plugins, and functionality.</p><p data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"391\" style=\"font-size: medium;\">This setup will allow safe testing of new integrations and updates before deployment to the live site.</p><p data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"653\" style=\"font-size: medium;\">In parallel, begin working on the HubSpot integration setup once the login credentials are confirmed and accessible. This includes preparing the environment for API connection, webhook configuration, and initial data flow testing between HubSpot and Entrata.</p><p data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"797\" style=\"font-size: medium;\">The goal of this task is to establish a stable local development environment and prepare the foundation for the HubSpot–Entrata integration.</p>', '2026-02-27', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-27 02:51:49', '2026-02-28 11:49:22', '2026-02-27 03:47:27', '2026-02-28 11:49:22', 0, 0),
