(6764, 21, 5, 'Optimizing apps/ removing stores', '<p>Optimizing apps/ removing stores and extra crons to reduce load on server.<br><br><google-sheets-html-origin style=\"font-size: medium;\"></google-sheets-html-origin></p><table xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" dir=\"ltr\" border=\"1\" data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-baot=\"1\" style=\"table-layout: fixed; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; width: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\"><colgroup><col width=\"610\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height: 21px;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); overflow: hidden; padding: 2px 3px; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Checked asia trade, all data matches comax.</td></tr><tr style=\"height: 21px;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); overflow: hidden; padding: 2px 3px; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Made minor changes to make sure we reset comapre_at price on shopify when sale is over.</td></tr><tr style=\"height: 21px;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); overflow: hidden; padding: 2px 3px; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Deleted extra crons, Freezed trash and the basement from syncing anything.</td></tr><tr style=\"height: 21px;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); overflow: hidden; padding: 2px 3px; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Optimized cron for 4kdrinks and yuka, applied cron commands in kernel instead of server, Also made sure to apply limits for max jobs and max tries.</td></tr><tr style=\"height: 21px;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); overflow: hidden; padding: 2px 3px; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Applied commands in kernel so that we can control them and they do not overlap.</td></tr><tr style=\"height: 21px;\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); overflow: hidden; padding: 2px 3px; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Will apply same in remaining stores too.</td></tr></tbody></table>', '2026-03-03', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-03-03 00:55:49', '2026-03-05 02:04:04', '2026-03-03 00:55:53', '2026-03-05 02:04:04', 0, 0),
